# BioKey Citizen Science - Participant Agreement

## What is this study?
We're exploring whether synchronized group meditation during sleep can improve 
sleep quality and well-being. This is a citizen science project - you're not 
just a participant, but a collaborator!

## What will I do?
- Install BioKey app on your phone
- Wear your smartwatch/tracker while sleeping
- Listen to brief meditation audio 3 nights/week
- Answer quick daily questions (< 1 min)
- Answer longer questionnaires monthly (5-10 min)
- Commit for 12 weeks

## What are the risks?
MINIMAL. You might:
- Experience brief sleep disruption from audio
- Feel mild frustration with technology
- Have minor privacy concerns

You should NOT participate if you have:
- Severe sleep disorders
- Epilepsy (audio uses no flashing/strobing)
- Inability to use smartphone apps

## What are the benefits?
- Free sleep tracking and insights
- Contribute to science
- Potential sleep quality improvements
- Access to your own data
- Early access to results

## What about my data?
YOUR DATA IS:
- Encrypted and secure
- De-identified (no names in database)
- You can download it anytime
- You can delete it anytime

YOUR DATA WILL BE:
- Analyzed in aggregate (grouped with others)
- Published in scientific papers (anonymized)
- Shared openly (de-identified dataset)

YOUR DATA WILL NOT BE:
- Sold to companies
- Shared with insurance
- Used for advertising
- Linked to your real identity in publications

## Can I quit?
YES! Anytime, no explanation needed.
- Just click "Withdraw" in app
- Your data will be deleted if you request it
- Or we can keep it (anonymized) if you agree

